Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:26.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那干吗 倍波\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What are you doing down there Beppo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Stand back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们抓着他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we have him at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:35.33,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《六座拿破仑半身像》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手上有什么不寻常的案子吗 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Anything remarkable on hand, Lestrade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么特别的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那跟我们说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then tell us about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你提到了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now you've come to mention it, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不否认我确实有心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's no denying there is something on my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四天前我接到第一个报案 引起了我注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It first came to my notice four days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冒斯·贺得逊在康宁顿路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A certain Morse Hudson has a shop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有家商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for the sale of pictures and statues{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出售图画和雕塑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in Kennington Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可昨晚发生了一件更严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But what happened last night was more serious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也很特别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and also more singular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}入室行窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Burglary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人闯入了巴尔尼柯大夫的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A house of a Doctor Barnicot was broken into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个半身像是巴尔尼柯大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now this bust was one of a pair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从冒斯·贺得逊店\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}purchased from Morse Hudson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}购买的其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by Doctor Barnicot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个放在了家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He had put it in his house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一个放在了离家两里外的诊所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The other he put two miles away in his surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那一晚的稍后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Later that same night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.97,0:09:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这还真的挺奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is certainly very novel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 所以我想你可能会感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, I thought it would please you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我觉得这可能属于\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Though in my opinion it comes more into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生大夫的领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Watson's line than ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疾病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Disease?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得是精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I should say madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还是奇怪的疯病\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Queer sort of madness too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能想象的到么 现在的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You wouldn't think there was anybody living, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当今社会的人 谁会如此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}now days would you, have such a hatred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}憎恨波拿巴·拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for Napoleon Bonaparte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 一些偏执狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Actually there are no limits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是很有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to the possibilities of monomania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You see there is the condition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国心理学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the modern French psychologists{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}称为「偏执的意念」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}have called a "idee fixe, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果一个人太沉迷于\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if someone became obsessed with say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如 他的祖先告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}an injustice committed to an ancestor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有关拿破仑战争时期的不公\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}during the Napoleonic wars, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很可能就形成了「偏执的意念」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he might form "idee fixe", {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种意念的影响下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and under its influence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能会变得狂躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he might be capable of any fantastic outrage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的华生 这种解释行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My dear Watson, that won't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How do you explain it then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't attempt to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是观察到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would simply observe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位绅士的疯狂举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that there's a certain method{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也有一定的规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in this gentleman's eccentric madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I mean for example, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在巴尔尼柯大夫的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in Dr. Barnicot's house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点声音可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where a sound might have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就惊醒全家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}aroused the sleeping family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半身像是先拿到外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the bust was taken outside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再被打碎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}before being broken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而在诊所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}whereas in his surgery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}危险就小多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where there was less danger of alarm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半身像就在原地被打碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was smashed where he stood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我提到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I only mentioned it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为你总会察觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}because you usually have a taste{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看似寻常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for all that is out of the common, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琐碎细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}no matter how trivial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会把任何事看得琐碎无关 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I dare call nothing trivial, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一些经典案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Some of my most classic cases{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是从小细节开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}have had the least promising commencement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿伯涅特家的恐怖事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That dreadful business of the Abernetty family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没有把全家人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I hardly call the dismemberment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}碎尸案看作琐碎小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of an entire family trivial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你愿意解释下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well Watson, would you be so kind as to explain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个案子能够破案就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well the point is that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为福尔摩斯注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it only came to Holmes' notice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热天里芹菜在黄油里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}because the depths which the parsley had sunk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会沉得多深而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}into the butter on a hot day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 我不能对三个半身像事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So you see I cannot afford to smile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一笑置之 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at your three busts, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 要是你让我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}However, I would be obliged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事件的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you would keep me informed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会深深感谢你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as to developments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听这个 福尔摩斯 立刻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Listen to this Holmes Come Instantly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯辛顿彼特街131号来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}1-3-1 Pitt Street, Kensington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's it about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事都可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well it could be anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我想可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I suspect it's a sequel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚他的故事有新进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to his story of last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的「偏执的意念」 把咖啡喝完\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you know my "idee fixe." Finish your coffee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}楼下有马车等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there's a cab at the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只给你两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少是件谋杀未遂案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's attempted murder at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这下伦敦的报童可要被团团围住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing less will hold the London message boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个年轻人蜷缩着肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a deed of violence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伸长着脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in that young fellow's round shoulders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以一定是发生了打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and outstretched neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德会告诉我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well, Lestrade will soon tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这些 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look at this, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面的台阶都冲刷过 其他的还是干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The bottom steps swilled down and the others dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.76,0:12:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Footsteps enough, anyhow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, but whose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是拿破仑半身像的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's the Napoleon bust business again, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又被打碎了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They smashed another?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm afraid the affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经发展到很严重的地步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}has taken a graver turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克先生 请容许我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Harker, allow me to present, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生 华生大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes and Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}中央报刊辛迪加的贺拉斯·哈克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Horace Harker, of the Central Press Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴你们能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good of you to come, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于我的焦躁 请见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please forgive my agitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没必要道歉 哈克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No apology necessary, Mr. Harker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一具尸体躺在门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A body on one's front doorstep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁都会不安的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is always unsettling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经告诉他们了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've told him then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个字都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们快告诉我们到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now tell us exactly what occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事很不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's an extraordinary thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All my life I've been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是在收集别人的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}collecting other people's news, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而现在我身上也发生了件真正的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and now I have a real life story of my own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我却一个字都写不出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I can't put two words together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我以记者的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If I had been a journalist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来到这里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and walked in through that door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将自己采访自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would have interviewed myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要在伦敦报上写两栏报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and had two columns in every London newspaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我不得不放弃这么有价值的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And here I am giving away valuable copy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一遍遍地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by telling my story{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向不同的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}over and over again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讲述我的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to a string of different people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 我听过你的大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}However, I've heard of your name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你能解释这件怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so if you could explain this queer business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'd be more than paid for my trouble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没白费\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in telling you my story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我通常要在书房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A great deal of my journalistic work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写稿到深夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is done at night in my den, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那个屋子 离这很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in that room adjacent to this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At some time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概是清晨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the small hours of this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一刻将不断地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall live that moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我梦中出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}over and over again in my dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道被害者是谁么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do we know who the murdered man was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不知道 如果你想看尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not yet but you can see the body at the mortuary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以去停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克先生 你从哪买的半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Where did you purchase your bust, Mr. Harker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从康宁路的贺得逊先生那\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From Mr. Hudson of Kennington Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那座半身像怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do we know what became of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门口的警官说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The officer at the door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在堪姆顿街\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}tells me it's been found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一所空房子的前院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the front garden{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到了半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of an empty house on Campden House Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正要去看看 你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was just going round to see it. Will you come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在就去 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In a moment, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凶手要不就是腿长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well the intruder either had very long legs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不就是动作灵活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or was a most active man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据下面的地势 要想爬到壁架\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}With that area beneath it was no mean feat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不是容易的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to climb up to this ledge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更别提打开窗户了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}let alone to open the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:18:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克先生 你能和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Harker, will you come with us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去看看半身像的碎片么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to see the remains of your bust?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须尽力将这事写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must make something of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}although I have no doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that every newspaper in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发行的各大报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will be on the streets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会详细地报道此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with a full and detailed account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.89,0:18:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我的命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just my luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得顿卡斯特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you remember when the stand fell down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看台倒塌事件吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at the Downcaster Races?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是看台上唯一的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was the only journalist in that stand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我的报纸是唯一一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and my journal was the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有刊登此事的报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that didn't have a published account{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我受的震动太大了 写不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}because I was too shaken to write a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在写发生在我家门口的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now I should be too late{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是晚了些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with a murder on my own doorstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have a long way to go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过已经掌握了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but there is one suggestive fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个人没有在屋内\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He didn't smash this in the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者屋子附近立刻打碎半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or immediately outside it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他当时遇到这个年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well perhaps he was so rattled and bustled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便慌乱起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by meeting this other fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道该怎么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that he hardly knew what he was doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.33,0:19:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's likely enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是为什么他要在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But why did he choose to destroy it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这栋特殊的房子外打碎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}outside this particular house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是座空房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's empty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他知道没人来打扰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so he knew he wouldn't be disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 但是街道那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, but there's another empty house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一栋空房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}further up the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定得先经过那栋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he must have passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他不在那打碎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why not destroy it there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 你终于答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}By Jove, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What are we to make of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Remember it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写在备案录里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Docket it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们稍后在讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We may come on something later, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个发现很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which will bear upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 在我们各自调查之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Meanwhile, before we go our separate ways{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议我们先去一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I suggest we make one last concerted visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 去哪？- 停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Where to? - The morgue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到现在也没能查出他的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They made nothing of his identity up to now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}衣服很破\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was poorly dressed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他并不像个劳工\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but doesn't seem to have been a laborer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁对这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Whoever's responsible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干出割喉这么残忍的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}did a nasty job on the fellow's throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死他的凶器\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh that was the murder weapon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一把锯齿小刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}had a serrated blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还不知道凶器是属于嫌犯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But whether it belonged to the murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是死者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or the dead man we don't yet know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他身上有能证明他身份的东西么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Anything in his pockets to help identify him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Precious little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 您在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If it might interest you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Forgive me, Lestrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是在思考一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was just contemplating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个我还没解决的谜团\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the one mystery that not even I can solve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Death itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Pray continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如你看到的 他身上没什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As you can see he carried very little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个苹果 一些绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}An apple, some string, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}map of London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and a photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照片被撕掉了一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well on part one it's torn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.68,0:21:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长相古怪的恶棍样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Odd looking devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟猿猴似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Positively simian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一步打算怎么办 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What steps do you propose next, Lestrade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.33,0:22:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依我所见 弄清内幕的最好办法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well the most practical way of getting at it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.21,0:22:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先弄清死者的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in my opinion, is to identify the dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦我们知道了他的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Once we know who he is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.11,0:22:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及和他有关的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and who his associates are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们便有个好的开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we should have a good start in learning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我们弄清谁在贺拉斯·哈克先生家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who killed him on the doorstep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.59,0:22:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}台阶上杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of Mr. Horace Harker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看是这样吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Don't you think so, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.61,0:22:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这不是我处理此案的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is not the way that I would conduct the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你打算怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And what would you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要受我的影响 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, don't let me influence you, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.65,0:22:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议你按照你的办案方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I suggest that you follow your line of inquiry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我按我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我们可以交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And we can compare notes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼此的线索和意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and each supplement the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你要回彼特街\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But if you are returning to Pitt Street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请告诉哈克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would be grateful if you would tell Mr. Harker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that I have quite made up my mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚来他家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And so there was a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一个危险的杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}dangerous and homicidal lunatic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且对拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with Napoleonic delusions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着很深的仇视\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at his house last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.79,0:23:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对他的报道有很大帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It will help him in his article.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.49,0:23:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你并不这么认为 对吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You don't seriously believe that, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.34,0:23:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Don't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我不这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well, perhaps not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.31,0:23:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我肯定这会使贺拉斯·哈克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure it will please Mr. Horace Harker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和中央情报辛迪加的订户们感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the subscribers to the Central Press Agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would be grateful, Lestrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.36,0:23:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你方便的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you could make it convenient{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚六点来贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to come around to Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我们见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at six o'clock this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And until then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想借用一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would like to keep this photograph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这张在死者口袋中的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}found in the dead man's pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 这可是个重要线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, Mr. Holmes that might be a vital clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.92,0:23:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然了 不然我也不会对它感兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I trust it is, otherwise it's of no interest to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝你好运 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good luck, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.99,0:24:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真不明白 我们干吗要纳税\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What we pay our taxes for, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然强盗都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When any ruffian can walk in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们眼皮底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and break one's goods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.85,0:24:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打碎东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}under one's nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.77,0:24:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他同时也让高超的工艺付诸东流\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A superb bit of craftsmanship it was too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷走笛万制作的皇帝头像的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Taken from a marble copy of the Emperor's head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}复制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by Dupr'e.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问您认识那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are you familiar, by chance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟大的艺术家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with that great artists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.68,0:24:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然认识 说到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes indeed. Speaking in familiarly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您认识照片中的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}do you recognize the man in this photograph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.24,0:24:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照片中的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Man in the photograph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.73,0:24:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确实认识他 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes indeed I do, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.24,0:24:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫倍波\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The names Beppo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.98,0:24:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倍波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Beppo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.41,0:24:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他是个意大利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes he was a sort of, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.62,0:24:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干零活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Italian piecework man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.85,0:24:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在这干过活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who made himself useful here in the shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.04,0:24:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会雕刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, he could carve a bit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做框子 镀金\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and frame, and guild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.15,0:24:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十天前我雇了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I took him on about ten days ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只在这干了一星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but he only stayed a week{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.40,0:24:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and then just disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他连工资都没拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Didn't even collect his wages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.41,0:24:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps he was responsible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.11,0:24:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打碎半身像有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for the breakages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.58,0:24:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打碎半身像？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Responsible for the breakages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.11,0:25:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打碎半身像 哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Huh, responsible for the breakages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 这一定是场国际阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My dear sir, this is an international conspiracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.23,0:25:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是无政府主义者策划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Nihilist plot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.22,0:25:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他们叫做红色共和军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Red republications I call them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.34,0:25:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.59,0:25:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有无政府主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No one but an Anarchist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.02,0:25:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才会打破雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}would go about breaking statues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有打碎你卖出去的其他东西么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did they break every one that you sold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我卖的其他东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Break every one I sold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No hardly that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.55,0:25:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有两个卖给本地的大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just the two bought by a local doctor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.36,0:25:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和留在我店中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the one left here in my shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.13,0:25:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于其他三个怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If anything happened to the other three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.87,0:25:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I know nothing of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.12,0:25:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有三个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.48,0:25:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是说原先有六个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So there was six to begin with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.01,0:25:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 是六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Six to begin with, yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这批来了六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A batch of six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.04,0:25:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我专门从\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I ordered them especially{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.26,0:25:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盖尔得尔和斯捷班尼公司定购的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from Gelder & Company of Stepney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的模型做得很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They do excellent molding work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道那几位顾客的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you happen to know the names and addresses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.57,0:25:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名字和住址么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of the other customers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.59,0:25:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我的账目\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My ledgers, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.02,0:25:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是很保密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}are confidential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.44,0:25:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贺得逊先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Hudson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你的理论是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you're theory's correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.66,0:25:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是不是该对这些人的危险阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}ought we to warn these people of this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.83,0:26:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发出警告呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this most dangerous plot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有谁能比歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And who better to do that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.85,0:26:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更适合做这事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}than Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.16,0:26:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.11,0:26:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, quite right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.53,0:26:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Quite right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.99,0:26:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国家松懈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, the country slumbers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.08,0:26:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们仍然该警醒着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but we shall remain vigilant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.59,0:26:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.33,0:26:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Follow me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.52,0:26:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.74,0:26:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}齐兹威克区的卓兹雅·布朗先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Josiah Brown of Chiswick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和瑞丁区的珊德福特夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and Mrs. Sandeford of Reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.47,0:26:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Mrs.? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贺得逊先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.02,0:26:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的两个半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did your two busts differ in anyway{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.13,0:26:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和其他四个有不同么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from the other four?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.49,0:26:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和其他四个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Differ from the other four?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 它们是完全一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no they were all identical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都经过很漂亮的装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They're all with a beautiful decoration, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.03,0:26:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我特别要求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which I ordered especially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Apart from the decoration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.83,0:26:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这六座半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}were your six busts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.43,0:26:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和其他的都一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the same as all the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.93,0:26:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和其他的一样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The same as all the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.68,0:26:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想应该是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I suppose so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.09,0:27:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们应该直接去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But you'd have to apply direct{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.76,0:27:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盖尔得尔和斯捷班尼公司问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to Gelder & Company to find that out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.37,0:27:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲自去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.97,0:27:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excellent idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.03,0:27:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.39,0:27:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们见到经理时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When you meet the manager{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.69,0:27:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能否提醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}would you be good enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.76,0:27:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心这个阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to warn him of the conspiracy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.38,0:27:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红色共和军很有可能利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}With all the busts they have on the premises{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.55,0:27:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些半身像大干一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the Red republicans could have field day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.47,0:27:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通常我们卖的半身像都不经过加工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Normally we sell the bust without decoration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.85,0:27:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是贺得逊先生要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but Mr. Hudson ordered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.62,0:27:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的制服都要上色\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the whole uniform be painted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.99,0:27:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个额外要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was extra detail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.63,0:27:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使雕塑看上去很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and made it a very special statue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.14,0:27:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 在做模型时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In times of the construction, however, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.99,0:27:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there is no reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.69,0:27:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}专门为贺得逊先生制作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}why the six napoleons we sold to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.37,0:27:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六个不同于其他的雕塑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}should be different from hundreds of others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.88,0:27:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 把两半模型拼在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You see the two molds are put together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.58,0:27:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再用石膏粘上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and filled with plaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.26,0:27:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是一个完整的半身像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to make the complete bust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.62,0:27:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是实心的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are they solid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.47,0:28:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Solid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.28,0:28:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes of coarse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.58,0:28:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后它们被放到一个特殊的屋子里风干\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then they are placed in a special room to dry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.57,0:28:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后储存起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and afterwards stored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.11,0:28:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}批发价是六先令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The wholesale price is six shillings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.20,0:28:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但可以卖到十二个先令以上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but we would get twelve or more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.96,0:28:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实在想不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can think of no reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.45,0:28:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么有人要摧毁它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that someone should wish to destroy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.34,0:28:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至为了这些杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Or murder for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.78,0:28:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们对模型的制作感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}your interest in the molding process{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.77,0:28:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是有原因的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}had ulterior motives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道您是否认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mendelstam, I wonder if you happen to recognize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照片中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the man in this photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.37,0:28:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:28:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.54,0:29:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们公司一向名声很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This has always been a respectable establishment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.75,0:29:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察只来过这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the only time we ever had the police in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.12,0:29:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是因为这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was over this fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.76,0:29:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概一年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}About a year ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.19,0:29:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在街上捅了一个意大利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he knifed another Italian in the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.63,0:29:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后躲到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and ran in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察随后就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with the police on his heels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是不是叫倍波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Was his name Beppo, by any chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 倍波\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Beppo, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.29,0:29:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来不知道他姓什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His second name, I never knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.59,0:29:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自认倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Served me right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.33,0:29:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雇了这么个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for employing a man with such a face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过他很会干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But he was a good workman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.41,0:29:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个不错的好手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}one of the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.12,0:29:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you happen to remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.61,0:29:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被捕的确切时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}exactly when he was arrested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.43,0:29:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查查工资单就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I could check the pay list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.67,0:29:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据冒斯·贺得逊记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}According to Morse Hudson's records{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.65,0:29:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您在去年6月3号\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you sold him six Napoleon's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.22,0:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖给了他六座半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on June the third, of last year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.05,0:29:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is correct{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.27,0:29:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倍波 最后一次领工资是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now Beppo, last collected his wages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.54,0:29:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on May the twentieth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.25,0:29:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}5月20号\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of that same year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他一定是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then he must have been arrested{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.35,0:29:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来的一周被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}sometime the following week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.95,0:30:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察一定有详细的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well no doubt the police have the exact details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.22,0:30:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个年轻的意大利人没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The young Italian survived so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.07,0:30:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 倍波只在监狱里待了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Beppo only went to prison for one year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.82,0:30:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他表弟也在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have a cousin of his work in here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.81,0:30:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许您想问问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}perhaps you would wish to speak with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.79,0:30:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求您一个字都别对他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not a word to the cousin, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The matter is very important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我越深入这件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the further I go with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.51,0:30:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越感到它的严重性\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the more important it seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.74,0:30:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样啊 我只是觉得也许他的表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And so yeah. I merely thought his cousin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道倍波被释放的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}might know when Beppo is to be released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.58,0:30:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曼杰利什塔姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mendelstam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.54,0:30:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我的猜测正确的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if my surmises are correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.47,0:30:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倍波已经被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}our friend Beppo has been out of jail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.39,0:30:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少有十一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for at least eleven days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.88,0:30:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hey, hey, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.26,0:30:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哈克已经设下了圈套 - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Harker has baited the traps. - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:30:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有人知道怎么利用报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The press is a very valuable institution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.99,0:31:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就是个很有用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if one knows how to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.50,0:31:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看报啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Read all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.30,0:31:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太狡猾了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Very cunning, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢啊 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.89,0:31:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lestrade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.06,0:31:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.16,0:31:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.22,0:32:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有进展吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what luck, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.07,0:32:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们今天太忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We've had a very busy day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.92,0:32:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且小有收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not entirely wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.94,0:32:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我追查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can trace each of the busts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.61,0:32:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个半身像的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}now from the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.49,0:32:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The busts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.74,0:32:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有你的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well of course you have your own methods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.34,0:32:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not for me to say a word against them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.86,0:32:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想我这一天的收获比你大\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I think I've done a better days work than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我弄清了死者的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've identified the dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Splendid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.17,0:32:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.49,0:32:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼埃拙·万努齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Pietro Venucci, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.99,0:32:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个意大利零售商的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}son of a respectable Italian tradesman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.01,0:32:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一个秘密政党有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that involved with a secret political society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.03,0:32:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红色无政府组织？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Red Anarchist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.63,0:32:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们一定见过冒斯·贺得逊先生了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh you've been talking to Morse Hudson haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.51,0:32:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续说 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do go on, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.85,0:32:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚说过 黑手党\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I refer, of course, to the Mafia, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.63,0:32:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which, as you may know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过暗杀来实现他们的信条\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}enforces its decrees by assassination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.40,0:32:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然 我们的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Obviously our murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.86,0:32:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}违反了某方面的纪律\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}broke the rules in some fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.39,0:32:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼埃拙在跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and Pietro is put on his track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.96,0:32:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能带着那张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Possibly with that photograph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.77,0:32:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了确认目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to aid identification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们碰面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They meet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.42,0:32:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在打斗中 彼埃拙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but Pietro receives his own death wound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.54,0:33:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受了致命伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the scuffle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.17,0:33:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很精彩 雷斯垂德 可我还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excellent, Lestrade, but I don't quite follow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.27,0:33:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对打破半身像的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}your explanation of the destruction of the busts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说福尔摩斯 半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dear Holmes, the busts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.28,0:33:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么老是忘不了半身像呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You can never get those busts out of your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.23,0:33:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半身像算不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The busts are nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.73,0:33:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小偷小摸 最多关六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Petty larceny, six months at most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.50,0:33:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.72,0:33:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们调查的是凶杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's murder we're really investigating, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老实说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.07,0:33:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经掌握了所有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm gathering all the threads into my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.94,0:33:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那下一步呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And the next stage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.36,0:33:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, well now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.93,0:33:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有个侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have an inspector who's made a specialty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.16,0:33:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}专门负责意大利区\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}out of the Italian quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.14,0:33:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和他去意大利区\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall go down there with him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.46,0:33:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找照片上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}find the man in that photograph you're carrying, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.72,0:33:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后以谋杀罪逮捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}arrest him for murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.24,0:33:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呢 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What you say, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.13,0:33:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我们一起去么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Will you come with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.11,0:33:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.92,0:33:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想很可能会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I fancy Chiswick as the address{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.43,0:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}齐兹威克区找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}most likely to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.38,0:33:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}齐兹威克区？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Chiswick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.73,0:33:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你和你的人愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If you and some of your men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.26,0:33:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚和我们一起去齐兹威克区\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will come with us to Chiswick tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.01,0:33:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我明天就和你一起去意大利区\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I will go to the Italian quarter with you tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耽误一天不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and there will be no harm in the delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.91,0:34:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我们一起吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I suggest you dine with us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.45,0:34:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后在沙发上休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and then you're welcome to the sofa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睡上一小觉对我们有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A few hours sleep will do us all good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.26,0:34:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概十一点出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't intend to leave the house before eleven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.94,0:34:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很可能得到天亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is unlikely that we shall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.64,0:34:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}be home before morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.21,0:34:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But Mr. Holmes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.09,0:34:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In the meantime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.73,0:34:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有封信需要通讯员送一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have a letter to send by Express Messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.83,0:34:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贺得逊夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.50,0:34:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贺得逊夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.04,0:34:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}齐兹威克区\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Chiswick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.82,0:35:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.21,0:35:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Pa Pa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Eleven o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen on your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.29,0:36:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该出发了 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come along Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.69,0:36:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, I think you've been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.61,0:36:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们葡萄酒喝得有点多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}overgenerous with the port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.93,0:36:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您对您的消息就够吝啬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've been frugal enough with your information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.70,0:36:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们坐四轮马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe that will be our four-wheeler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.72,0:36:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别忘了带我的手枪 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Don't forget the revolver, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.25,0:36:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有小毯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and bring the rugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.23,0:36:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次行动不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This outing wouldn't be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.28,0:36:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受「偏执的意念」的启发吧 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}inspired by your'idee fix, ' would it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.10,0:36:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 「偏执的意念」 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- "Idee fixe." - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.43,0:36:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}石膏半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The plaster bust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.68,0:36:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有很大把握 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have great hopes, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.63,0:36:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 我有三分之二的把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In fact, I bet it's exactly two-to-one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.41,0:36:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你今晚跟我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that if you come with us tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天亮之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you'll have the murderer in custody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.09,0:36:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就能抓到凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}before the sun rises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.97,0:36:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不打赌 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm not a betting man, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.13,0:36:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你也就没什么可输的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then you have nothing to lose by it do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.89,0:36:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了一个好觉而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Except a good nights sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.49,0:37:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你要是感冒就是自找的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, if you've caught a cold it's your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.85,0:37:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁让你把毯子落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You left the rugs behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.50,0:37:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sorry, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两点了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is that two o'clock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能抽烟 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't suppose we can smoke, can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.70,0:37:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不能 - 想想而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Nope. - Thought as much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.76,0:38:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的人都到位了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are your men in position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.29,0:38:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来点薄荷糖 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have a humbug, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.49,0:38:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.54,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可没时间吃糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this is no time for humbugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.90,0:38:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是你等的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is that who you expected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.30,0:38:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫倍波\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His name's Beppo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.04,0:38:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这名字很适合猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good name for a monkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.92,0:39:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会从后门逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He'll leave by the back door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.94,0:39:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为其他门都锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Cause all the other doors are locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.54,0:40:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 都碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh dear, it's smashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.13,0:40:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想您就是卓兹雅·布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Josiah Brown, I presume?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.22,0:40:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.44,0:40:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用说 您一定是歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And you, no doubt, are Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.81,0:40:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到了您让邮差送来的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had the note you sent by the express messenger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.63,0:40:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全按照您的吩咐做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I did exactly as you told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.99,0:40:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按照您的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Following your instructions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.59,0:40:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把门都锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we locked every door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好把他引到后门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so as to lead him into the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.42,0:40:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴您抓到了这个恶棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I'm very glad to see you have the rascal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.83,0:40:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now I hope, gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.61,0:40:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们能进屋坐坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you will come and partake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.21,0:40:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃些点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in some refreshment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.64,0:40:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 布朗先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Mr. Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.58,0:40:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过时间不早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The hour is rather late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.85,0:40:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.27,0:40:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.84,0:40:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走了 华生 我们还有别的事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come, Watson, we have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.59,0:40:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德 如果你今晚六点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lestrade, if you will come around to Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.73,0:40:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来贝克街的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}tonight at six o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.45,0:40:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会给你说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I hope to be able to show you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.94,0:40:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到现在你还没有完全了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you still have not grasped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.51,0:40:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个案件的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the full meaning of this business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.21,0:40:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你会发现我的黑手党理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, I think you'll find my theory of the Mafia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.09,0:41:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是正确的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will work out all right, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.95,0:41:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good night, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.32,0:41:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come along now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.69,0:41:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Baker Street please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.21,0:41:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 华生 我要告诉你一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And now, Watson, I commend to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}适合所有问题的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the universal answer to almost all the problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.78,0:41:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's that, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.21,0:41:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.42,0:41:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.62,0:41:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.64,0:42:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[意大利语]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.65,0:42:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Morning Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.35,0:42:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于倍波的首次被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And since the manager of Gelder & Company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.54,0:42:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和盖尔得尔公司的经理有很大关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was mainly responsible for Beppo's initial arrest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.84,0:42:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们认为他为了报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we see the breaking of the busts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.58,0:42:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才打碎了那些半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as a pathetic attempt to revenge himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.75,0:42:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过很可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And it was possibly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.21,0:42:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是无意的暴力行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the senseless acts of violence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.78,0:42:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是违反了黑手党的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which transgressed the Mafia's code of behavior{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.70,0:42:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才导致了万努齐的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and lead to the murder of young Venucci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.47,0:42:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里 我想到了昨晚你提到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There, I think that takes care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.39,0:42:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of those details you mentioned last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.42,0:42:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Don't you, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.95,0:42:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.33,0:42:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.42,0:42:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么看雷斯垂德的推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well what do you think of Lestrade's theories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.92,0:42:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信那一定很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure that they are of the greatest interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.64,0:42:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I regret to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.47,0:42:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个字都没听进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've not listened to a word of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.36,0:42:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我的走神 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Forgive my inattention Lestrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.14,0:42:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我昨晚睡得太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had a rather late night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.51,0:43:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我睡得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look, what do you think I had?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.79,0:43:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.59,0:43:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is Mr. Sherlock Holmes here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.09,0:43:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.94,0:43:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I fear I am a little late{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.68,0:43:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过火车实在是太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but the trains were very awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.39,0:43:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No matter, no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.27,0:43:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您把东西带来么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have you brought the item?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.51,0:43:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是我朋友和同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh these are my friends and colleagues, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.14,0:43:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生大夫和苏格兰场的雷斯垂德探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Watson and Inspector Lestrade of Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.34,0:43:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您放心地说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You may speak freely in front of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.60,0:43:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 您在电报中说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen, you said in your telegram{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.38,0:43:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贺得逊先生告诉了您我的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that Mr. Hudson had given you my address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.85,0:43:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞丁区的珊德福特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sandeford, of Reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.56,0:43:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The same, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.81,0:43:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.17,0:43:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是那些半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's those busts again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.56,0:43:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说得对 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Correct, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.47,0:43:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有告诉您\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did he also tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.86,0:43:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子花了多少钱买的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}just how much my wife paid for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.81,0:43:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他并没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No he did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.49,0:43:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我并不富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well sir, I am an honest man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.71,0:43:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我是个老实人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and not a very rich one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.17,0:43:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她只花了十五个先令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and she only gave fifteen shillings for it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.74,0:43:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我拿走您电报中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I think you ought to know that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.76,0:44:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提到的十英镑前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}before I take the ten pounds from you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.60,0:44:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您有必要知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you offered in your telegraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.20,0:44:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的顾虑说明您很诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh your scruple does you much honor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.26,0:44:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珊德福特先生 既然我已经开价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sandeford but I have stated my price{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.75,0:44:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就要坚持这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I shall stick to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.29,0:44:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 福尔摩斯先生 您太慷慨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh thank you, Mr. Holmes, that's very handsome of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.94,0:44:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给您半身像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You're bust sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.81,0:44:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子总是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know my wife has always maintained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.13,0:44:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和这位君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there is a marked resemblance between{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.46,0:44:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着显著的相同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}myself and the Emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.04,0:44:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己没看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can't say I see it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.28,0:44:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第六座拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sixth Napoleon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.23,0:44:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早我用电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I contacted Mrs. Sandeford{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.83,0:44:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}联系了珊德福特夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by telegram this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.96,0:44:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您当着见证人的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you will sign this paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.06,0:44:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这张纸上签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in front of witnesses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.11,0:44:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it is simply to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.32,0:44:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您将与这座半身像有关的一切权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you transferred every possible rights{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.10,0:44:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都转让给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you would ever have in the bust to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.16,0:44:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乐意之极 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Happy to, Mr. Holmes, happy, happy, happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.53,0:44:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个循规蹈矩的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am a methodical man and one never knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.93,0:44:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人无法预测将来会出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what turn of events my take afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.81,0:44:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是您的十英镑 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here is your ten-pound note sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.58,0:44:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 珊德福特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good evening, Mr. Sandeford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.43,0:44:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you very much, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.55,0:45:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's good evening, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.78,0:45:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And it's very, very kind of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.18,0:45:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢 您的价格太让我满意了 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you so much, and I'm very pleased of that. Oh my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.34,0:45:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.84,0:45:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注意啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you will give me your undivided attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.28,0:46:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}允许我向你们介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen, allow me to introduce you to one of{\r}
