Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.36,0:46:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太妙了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Bravo, Holmes, bravo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.01,0:46:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh you're a legend to man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.44,0:46:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是堪比魔术大师马斯基林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Rival that of Maskelyne himself{\r}
