Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.93,0:46:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从这颗包格斯珍珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Borgias pearl's been missing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.57,0:46:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在科隆那王子在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}since it disappeared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.10,0:46:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达柯尔旅馆的卧室丢失后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from the Prince of Colonna's bedroom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.73,0:46:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经消失很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in that Dacre Hotel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.51,0:46:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概有一年了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}over a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.68,0:46:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能还记得 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As you may remember, Lestrade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.59,0:46:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察曾经向我请教过这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was consulted upon the case at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.69,0:47:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直在观察比较\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Observe and learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.61,0:47:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当万努齐的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The moment the name Venucci{\r}
