Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.81,0:47:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立刻激起了我的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I immediately became intrigued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.42,0:47:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一段时间内 科隆那王妃的女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Princess of Colonna's maid, for some time, {\r}
